<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab gunmen ambushed road construction workers on the Arabia-Lafey road in Mandera, killing eight, including two police reservists, and also stormed the Mjengo site, killing at least eight more. Somali security forces opened fire on protesters in Mogadishu, killing three civilians, while a former prime minister accused the government of cutting payments to 10,000 soldiers and families. President Mohamud declared fighting Al-Shabaab a top priority in Jowhar, and regional leaders warned of consequences if federal troops attack the Hiiraan region. Egypt, Somalia and Djibouti held talks reaffirming their exclusive role in securing the Red Sea waterway. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQcmEzeUVLS1hTYjI1WXhmS2x2NW9XcmhnNFlvUExxVkZxRk5KckI2eDVOZmdvTUVnZjlrX25neG1wYzVIZlhMMkxiTVpRdEZXRlJzVUVTSUFRRV9FSVlsWWNORmluQmt5ZWc0eEFnZGpyWlBZTjNpQU1UbkNmM2VBYkRFOTV6ZGNkdThTX1M0cmhaTEZlSmdRZGtLb00wY0lGaXlWS2d6cXpPcnRfY3ZNR1NZZTQxYmQ5N05WRg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawan Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTFBaNnp6MWpOVEFtOGNWX3daSHIwQXZieVR5ektfTXpxVUJMb0hQSDBpZTljc1NKWFZzYTNZRjlWLVZ5bDJsc003b0tfNURDNTdzb3IxZi1uSngyT19kRTFGY19ORWZGNFdpTWxHcjJrWFV4QW5lTHBsODY2QWE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Kenya Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxPdnhFRk82RjlRMHhTTlFsVTFSUXlONHVPTW1qMV9XZVo5eGtLYTBuMGZwaEE1ak5tcms4VVlmSlFGNHptdnJJSHplZVIxS2REZTJiNFN2Y18wZ0hFZVlma0g5cWQ2RHJnZGJZc1Z6MTdfS05XR25iaDVFVDh5U1dRZW5kX19JV0ZUbWRUQjdQbnlFQmx4NHRWNlNuNXNhbFRJUVlfaGF5SC1iM1EzQWV3ODZWWHBTYUplZVp4VGp5Z0MwaTdIcGR6RnBBMWVKdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pulse Kenya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxOYUx2RjRqMXZqZjlTa1hOSkp2VDNuMTRmYzBo